// The change of basis of conformal(d) to R(d+1, 1, 0), for d from 1 to 4,
// with the rows of P as in the namespace conformal: e_i of conformal(d) goes
// to e'_i for i <= d, the origin e(d+1) to (e'(d+2) - e'(d+1)) / 2, and the
// point at infinity e(d+2) to e'(d+2) + e'(d+1), where e'(d+1) squares to +1
// and e'(d+2) to -1. Each blade e_A goes to the sum over the blades e'_B of
// its grade of the minor det P[A, B] times e'_B. det P = -1, so e(d+1)(d+2)
// goes to -e'(d+1)(d+2) and the antiscalar to its negation. Per d: the image
// of every blade of conformal(d) (to_diagonal) and of every blade of
// R(d+1, 1, 0) under the inverse change (from_diagonal), indexed by mask.
