// with G the metric exomorphism and antiG = left G right, so that a ^
// bulk_dual(b) = (a . b) antiscalar for a and b of equal grade. Each was
// computed from these definitions and again from the products: the bulk dual
// as the geometric product of reverse(u) and the antiscalar, the weight dual
